## Inference (experimental)
# EXPERIMENTAL detectors (docs/inference.md), off unless `inference` is in
# COMPOSE_PROFILES: persistent congestion (Jitterbug) and loss degradation
# (change points on packet loss), per ICMP target, every INFERENCE_INTERVAL
# seconds (default 3600). Windows: INFERENCE_CONGESTION_DAYS (14) and
# INFERENCE_DEGRADATION_DAYS (7). INFERENCE_SINCE (YYYY-MM-DD): never look
# before this date, e.g. after a move or a change of provider. Targets: the
# Influx categories in INFERENCE_CATEGORIES (default topsites,custom,cpe), or
# exactly INFERENCE_TARGETS when set. A degradation lasts at least
# INFERENCE_DEGRADATION_MIN_MINUTES (30) at INFERENCE_DEGRADATION_LOSS_PCT
# (2) mean loss or more.
#: int min=1
INFERENCE_INTERVAL=
#: int min=1
INFERENCE_CONGESTION_DAYS=
#: int min=1
INFERENCE_DEGRADATION_DAYS=
#: date
INFERENCE_SINCE=
INFERENCE_CATEGORIES=
INFERENCE_TARGETS=
#: float min=0
INFERENCE_DEGRADATION_MIN_MINUTES=
#: float min=0 max=100
INFERENCE_DEGRADATION_LOSS_PCT=

